From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Build tooling contributors <build-tools@example.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 18:27:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: retain test outcomes through telemetry queue
 pressure

A full telemetry ingress queue can discard test lifecycle and finalization events while native tests finish successfully. A drain can also acknowledge a stream before accepted tail events are converted.

Retain outcome and context overflow in a private disk FIFO sharing the replay quota, preserve ordering across priority and finality paths, and report incomplete delivery on bounded storage or drain failures.
